{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05790","headline":"嵩山十志十首 其六 · 卢鸿一","name":"嵩山十志十首 其六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"霏微阴壑兮气腾虹，迤逦危磴兮上凌空。\n青霞杪兮紫云垂，鸾歌凤舞兮吹参差。\n鸾吹凤舞兮期仙磴，鸿驾迎兮瑶华赠。\n山中人兮好神仙，想像闻此兮欲升烟，铸月炼液兮竚还年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢鸿一","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05790.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05790","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}